### Giriş yap
# @name login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@shop.com", "password": "Admin123!" }

@token = BURAYA_ACCESS_TOKEN

# ============ SİPARİŞ AKIŞI ============
# Önce: sepete ürün ekle (cart-test.http) + adres ekle (cart-test.http)

### Sipariş oluştur (checkout) - sahte kart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "addressId": "BURAYA_ADRES_ID",
  "payment": {
    "cardNumber": "1234567812345678",
    "cardHolder": "Ali Veli",
    "expiry": "12/28",
    "cvv": "123"
  }
}

### Geçersiz kart denemesi (kısa numara - 400 dönmeli)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "addressId": "BURAYA_ADRES_ID",
  "payment": { "cardNumber": "123", "cardHolder": "X", "expiry": "12/28", "cvv": "123" }
}

### Kendi siparişlerim
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tek sipariş detayı
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/BURAYA_SIPARIS_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ============ ADMIN ============

### Tüm siparişler (admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sipariş durumu güncelle (admin)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/orders/admin/BURAYA_SIPARIS_ID/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "status": "SHIPPED" }
